    "why": [
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 57/100 (+15 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by +0.2 t C/ha, saving 1.9 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 122 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 45.1 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9112,609/ha (\u20b945,571/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b994,100/ha (\u20b938,081/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Crop Diversification / Mera Pani Meri Virasat (\u20b917,500/ha state incentive); CRM Sub-Mission on Crop Residue Management (50\u201380% Happy Seeder / CHC subsidy)."
    ],
